# =============================================================================
# PermRepo — Environment Variables (TEMPLATE)
# PermRepo — Vides Mainīgie (PARAUGS)
# PermRepo — Mediaj Variabloj (SKIZO)
# =============================================================================
# This is a TEMPLATE. Copy to .env and fill in your values:
# Šis ir PARAUGS. Kopē uz .env un aizpildi ar savām vērtībām:
# Ĉi tio estas SKIZO. Kopiu al .env kaj plenigu per viaj valoroj:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# 🔴 NEVER commit the .env file!
# 🔴 NEKAD necommito .env failu!
# 🔴 NENIAM komitu la .env-dosieron!
#
# ✅ .env.example CAN be committed (no secrets)
# ✅ .env.example VAR commitēt (bez secrets)
# ✅ .env.example POVAS esti komitita (sen sekretoj)
#
# ⚠️  Testnet values are ACTIVE (uncommented) by default.
# ⚠️  Mainnet values are COMMENTED OUT — uncomment to switch.
# ⚠️  Testnet vērtības ir AKTĪVAS (nekomentētas) pēc noklusējuma.
# ⚠️  Mainnet vērtības ir KOMENTĒTAS — atkomentē, lai pārslēgtos.
# ⚠️  Testretaj valoroj estas AKTIVAJ (senkomentaj) defaŭlte.
# ⚠️  Ĉefretaj valoroj estas KOMENTITAJ — malkomentu por ŝalti.
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub OAuth
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub OAuth Client ID.
# Get from: https://github.com/settings/developers
# GitHub OAuth klienta ID.
# Iegūsti no: https://github.com/settings/developers
# GitHub OAuth Klienta ID.
# Akiru de: https://github.com/settings/developers
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=your_github_client_id_here

# GitHub OAuth Client Secret.
# Get from: https://github.com/settings/developers
# GitHub OAuth klienta noslēpums.
# Iegūsti no: https://github.com/settings/developers
# GitHub OAuth Klienta Sekreto.
# Akiru de: https://github.com/settings/developers
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=your_github_client_secret_here

# GitHub OAuth Redirect URI.
# Must match the callback URL in GitHub OAuth App settings.
# GitHub OAuth pāradresācijas URI.
# Jāsakrīt ar callback URL GitHub OAuth App iestatījumos.
# GitHub OAuth Redirekta URI.
# Devas kongrui kun la callback URL en GitHub OAuth App-agordoj.
GITHUB_REDIRECT_URI=https://your-domain.com/api/github/callback

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Session
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Session secret key for signing cookies.
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
# Minimum length: 32 characters.
# Sesijas slepenā atslēga sīkdatņu parakstīšanai (paša izdomāts/ģenerēts nejauši).
# Ģenerē ar: openssl rand -hex 32
# Minimālais garums: 32 rakstzīmes.
# Sesia sekreta ŝlosilo por subskribi kuketojn.
# Generu per: openssl rand -hex 32
# Minimuma longo: 32 signoj.
# Šī vērtība tiek izmantota arī AES-256-GCM Redis sesiju šifrēšanas atslēgas HKDF atvasināšanai.
SESSION_SECRET=your_32_char_session_secret_here

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Redis (Upstash)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Upstash Redis REST URL.
# Get from: https://console.upstash.com
# Upstash Redis REST URL.
# Iegūsti no: https://console.upstash.com
# Upstash Redis REST URL.
# Akiru de: https://console.upstash.com
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://your-redis-url.upstash.io

# Upstash Redis REST Token.
# Get from: https://console.upstash.com
# Upstash Redis REST tokens.
# Iegūsti no: https://console.upstash.com
# Upstash Redis REST Tokens.
# Akiru de: https://console.upstash.com
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=your_upstash_redis_token_here

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Redis TTL (seconds)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# How long backup job is stored in Redis (seconds).
# Default: 86400 (24 hours).
# Cik ilgi backup job glabājas Redis (sekundes).
# Noklusējums: 86400 (24 stundas).
# Kiom longe sekurkopia tasko estas konservita en Redis (sekundoj).
# Defaŭlto: 86400 (24 horoj).
JOB_TTL_SECONDS=86400

# How long job lock is held in Redis (seconds).
# Recommended: 600 (10 minutes) for large ZIPs.
# Cik ilgi job slēdzeni tur Redis (sekundes).
# Ieteicams: 600 (10 minūtes) lieliem ZIP.
# Kiom longe taska ŝloso estas tenita en Redis (sekundoj).
# Rekomendite: 600 (10 minutoj) por grandaj ZIP.
JOB_LOCK_TTL_SECONDS=600

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mint Authorization (EIP-712)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Backend-only private key used to sign EIP-712 mint authorizations.
# This key does NOT pay gas and does NOT mint NFTs.
# The backend signs only after checking GitHub repository permissions.
# Set the REAL value in Render → Environment Variables, not in this file.
# Never commit a real private key to GitHub.
#
# Backenda privātā atslēga EIP-712 mint autorizāciju parakstīšanai.
# Šī atslēga nemaksā gas un nemintē NFT.
# Backend paraksta tikai pēc GitHub repozitorija tiesību pārbaudes.
# ĪSTO vērtību iestati Render → Environment Variables, nevis šajā failā.
# Nekad necommito īstu privāto atslēgu GitHub repozitorijā.
#
# Malantaŭa privata ŝlosilo por subskribi EIP-712 mint-rajtigojn.
# Ĉi tiu ŝlosilo ne pagas gas-kotizojn kaj ne mintas NFT-ojn.
# La backend subskribas nur post kontrolo de GitHub-deponejaj permesoj.
# Agordu la REALAN valoron en Render → Environment Variables, ne en ĉi tiu dosiero.
# Neniam komitu veran privatan ŝlosilon al GitHub.
#
# Generate a new wallet if needed:
#   node -e "const { ethers } = require('ethers'); const w = ethers.Wallet.createRandom(); console.log('Address:', w.address); console.log('Private Key:', w.privateKey);"
#
# 🔴 NEVER share this private key!
# 🔴 NEKAD nedalies ar šo privāto atslēgu!
# 🔴 NENIAM kunhavigu ĉi tiun privatan ŝlosilon!
MINT_AUTHORIZATION_SIGNER_PRIVATE_KEY=""

# =============================================================================
# TESTNET — Base Sepolia
# =============================================================================
# Chain ID for Base Sepolia testnet.
# Ķēdes ID Base Sepolia testnetam.
# Ĉena ID por Base Sepolia testreto.
# Base Sepolia (Devnet): ANS-104 signature verification is skipped, but structure and ID/data binding remain mandatory.
CHAIN_ID=0x14a34

# RPC URL for Base Sepolia.
# RPC URL Base Sepolia.
# RPC URL por Base Sepolia.
RPC_URL=https://sepolia.base.org

# Optional comma-separated fallback RPC endpoints for server-side reads.
# RPC_FALLBACK_URLS=https://your-backup-rpc.example

# Minimum canonical block confirmations required before completing a backup.
# Choose a value appropriate for the deployed network.
TX_CONFIRMATIONS=1

# NFT contract address (Base Sepolia).
# NFT kontrakta adrese (Base Sepolia).
# NFT-kontrakta adreso (Base Sepolia).
NFT_ADDRESS=0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000

# Subscription contract address (Base Sepolia).
# Subscription kontrakta adrese (Base Sepolia).
# Abona kontrakta adreso (Base Sepolia).
SUBSCRIPTION_ADDRESS=0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000

# USDC contract address (Base Sepolia).
# USDC kontrakta adrese (Base Sepolia).
# USDC-kontrakta adreso (Base Sepolia).
USDC_ADDRESS=0x036CbD53842c5426634e7929541eC2318f3dCF7e

# Arweave gateway URL (for reading data).
# Arweave gateway URL (datu lasīšanai).
# Arweave-pordego URL (por legi datumojn).
ARWEAVE_GATEWAY=https://arweave.net

# Secondary AR.IO gateway used for ANS-104 data-item verification and fallback reads.
AR_IO_GATEWAY=https://ar-io.dev

# Require ANS-104 root transaction/offset/size metadata when verifying manifests.
# true (default): stop if the gateway cannot provide a valid location.
# false: allow loading without raw ANS-104 byte-range verification if location is unavailable.
# This does NOT disable JSON/schema validation or a mismatching response-ID check.
REQUIRE_ANS104_LOCATION=true

# Turbo Upload URL (Base Sepolia / testnet).
# Turbo Upload URL (Base Sepolia / testnet).
# Turbo Alŝuta URL (Base Sepolia / testreto).
TURBO_UPLOAD_URL=https://upload.services.ar-io.dev

# Turbo Payment URL (Base Sepolia / testnet).
# Turbo Payment URL (Base Sepolia / testnet).
# Turbo Paga URL (Base Sepolia / testreto).
TURBO_PAYMENT_URL=https://payment.services.ar-io.dev


