# How long backup job is stored in Redis (seconds).
# Cik ilgi backup job glabājas Redis (sekundes).
# Kiom longe sekurkopia tasko estas konservita en Redis (sekundoj).
# JOB_TTL_SECONDS=86400

# How long job lock is held in Redis (seconds).
# Cik ilgi job slēdzeni tur Redis (sekundes).
